"Whisperer of Refuge is the knight skill of Jozz-art'h, chosen partly to complement his sister Sina's."
"Knights of one family or squad often choose skills to complement each other."
"It protects an area that only those told about the refuge may enter."
"Its refuge keeps the land healthy rather than preserved, and hides its holder from demons."
"The refuge serves as a base for restoring the land around it."
